  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/10/IMG_1782.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El sal&oacute;n de actos de la Caja Rural de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este lunes un desfile de moda infantil, organizado por las Amas de Casa, con ropa de la tienda 7 Colores, en El Pla, y la zapatos de&nbsp;Passets, en la calle Salvador Barri.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaamescasa7colressabateriapassets/img_1764.jpg\" alt=\"img_1764\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaamescasa7colressabateriapassets/img_1765.jpg\" alt=\"img_1765\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaamescasa7colressabateriapassets/img_1766.jpg\" alt=\"img_1766\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaamescasa7colressabateriapassets/img_1767.jpg\" alt=\"img_1767\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaamescasa7colressabateriapassets/img_1768.jpg\" alt=\"img_1768\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaamescasa7colressabateriapassets/img_1769.jpg\" alt=\"img_1769\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaamescasa7colressabateriapassets/img_1770.jpg\" alt=\"img_1770\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaamescasa7colressabateriapassets/img_1771.jpg\" alt=\"img_1771\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaamescasa7colressab